# Documentation Organization Walkthrough

## 🎯 Objective

Created a comprehensive getting started guide for the Gurudevi project by exploring the existing "Docs v 3.0" folder and synthesizing the AI_CONTEXT and BUILD_ORDER documentation into a clear, actionable onboarding path.

---

