## 🎓 Onboarding Path Summary

### For First-Time Contributors

**Day 1 - Understand the Vision** (30 min)
1. Read [GETTING_STARTED.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/GETTING_STARTED.md) Quick Orientation
2. Read [NORTH_STAR.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/NORTH_STAR.md)
3. Skim [GURUDEVI_MASTER_DOCUMENT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/GURUDEVI_MASTER_DOCUMENT.md)

**Day 1 - Understand the System** (45 min)
4. Read [GURUDEVI_ARCHITECTURE_v4_0_UPDATED.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/GURUDEVI_ARCHITECTURE_v4_0_UPDATED.md) (focus on database schema)
5. Read [DESIGN_SYSTEM.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md)

**Day 1 - Know What to Build** (15 min)
6. Read [CURRENT_SPRINT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/CURRENT_SPRINT.md)
7. Read [BUILD_ORDER.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/BUILD_ORDER.md) to understand sequence

**Ready to build!** 🚀

### For AI Agents Starting a Session

1. Read [GETTING_STARTED.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/GETTING_STARTED.md) (skim if returning)
2. Check [CURRENT_SPRINT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/CURRENT_SPRINT.md) for priorities
3. Reference [AI_CONTEXT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/AI_CONTEXT.md) while coding
4. Build following the principles in [NORTH_STAR.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/NORTH_STAR.md)

