## 🌸 The Lotus Teaching

The getting started guide embodies the lotus philosophy:

- **Rooted in mud**: Acknowledges complexity of building a sanctuary platform
- **Rising through water**: Provides clear path from beginner to contributor
- **Hydrophobic surface**: Protects against common mistakes (wrong build order, hardcoded text)
- **Blooming above**: Enables developers to build beautiful, meaningful features

---

**From mud, through water, to full bloom.** 🪷

**ජයවේවා** (Jayawewa - May you be victorious!)
